        "text": "Voxtral 3: Mistral's voice agent SDK for real-time speech in 50+ languages — accurate transcription, emotional TTS, deep tool use. EU-hosted or self-deployed.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/voxtral-3/",
