      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Voxtral 3: Voice Agent SDK & Speech Models in 50+ Languages • • • • • • • • • •",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/voxtral-3/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-21T00:36:04.805Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Voxtral 3 introduces a cutting-edge voice agent SDK and state-of-the-art speech models designed for real-time, multi-step conversations across 50+ languages.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/voxtral-3/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-21T00:36:04.805Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To address this, we introduce Voxtral 3: a new family of state-of-the-art speech-to-text and text-to-speech models, alongside a voice agent SDK that brings listening, thinking, tool calling, and speaking into a single real-time streaming pipeline.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/voxtral-3/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-21T00:36:04.805Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Voxtral 3 is built to create natural conversational experiences, from contact-center agents and service desks to virtual assistants and hands-free copilots.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/voxtral-3/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-21T00:36:04.805Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As with other Mistral models, the Voxtral 3 family is designed for sovereign deployment.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/voxtral-3/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-21T00:36:04.805Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The speech-to-text model, Voxtral Small Transcribe 3 , is state-of-the-art in multilingual transcription, identifying who said what (diarization), using keyphrases to improve its accuracy (context-biasing).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/voxtral-3/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-21T00:36:04.805Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The text-to-speech model, Voxtral Mini TTS 3 , introduces new voices that adjust their emotion, pace, and emphasis based on conversational context, with support for 35+ languages and 50+ dialects.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/voxtral-3/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-21T00:36:04.805Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For professional use cases where basic voice cloning does not suffice, Voxtral’s Pro Voice adaptation is able to reproduce a speaker’s distinctive character, emotional range, and speaking style across languages, using just 30 minutes of audio.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/voxtral-3/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-21T00:36:04.805Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Use Mistral's EU-hosted API or deploy Voxtral 3 on your own infrastructure.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/voxtral-3/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-21T00:36:04.805Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Voxtral Mini TTS 3.0 , available in batch and realtime, achieves state-of-the-art expressiveness and instruction following for 35+ languages and 50+ dialects.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/voxtral-3/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-21T00:36:04.805Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Voxtral Mini Transcribe Realtime 3 listens and detects when the caller has finished speaking, a general model—like Mistral Small —reasons and calls tools, and Voxtral Speech 3 replies in the tone of the conversation so far.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/voxtral-3/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-21T00:36:04.805Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Voxtral 3 is available today through the Mistral API, hosted through our European, US, and global endpoints.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://mistral.ai/news/voxtral-3/",
        "source": "Mistral AI",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:22.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-21T00:36:04.805Z"
      }
